{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"alias":"notaphilic-autumnal-raccoon","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Goal\nCut rebar 0.14.0, a minor release, following docs/releasing.md. 0.13.1 (2026-08-30) is the latest on PyPI and GitHub Releases, and main carries 609 commits since then.\n\n## Preconditions (checked 2026-10-29)\n- `release.yml` publishes to PyPI and the MCP Registry through OIDC; no stored secret is needed. The `pypi` environment requires reviewer JoeOakhartNava and allows only `main`.\n- The release-lane dependency advisory gate (`scripts/dependency_audit.py gate --lane release`) passes locally: no known vulnerabilities.\n- Version is carried by pyproject.toml, server.json (top-level and packages[]), tests/unit/api_surface_baseline.json and uv.lock.\n\n## Plan\n1. Bump 0.13.1 -> 0.14.0 in pyproject.toml, server.json (both fields), and regenerate tests/unit/api_surface_baseline.json (`python scripts/gen_api_surface.py --update`) and uv.lock (`uv lock`), checking each diff changes only the version.\n2. CHANGELOG.md: the `## [Unreleased]` section currently sits below `## [0.13.1]` and holds the curated post-0.13.1 entries. Retitle it `## [0.14.0] - <release date>`, move it above 0.13.1, open an empty `## [Unreleased]` at the top, add the 0.14.0 compare link, and curate entries for commits it does not yet cover.\n3. docs/releasing.md step 1: add uv.lock to the files to bump (the 0.13.1 release commit bumped it, but the runbook omits it, so `uv sync --locked` fails for anyone following the runbook as written).\n4. make verify, push to Gerrit, land at LLM-Review +1 / Verified +1.\n5. Dispatch `gh workflow run release.yml --ref main -f version=0.14.0`, approve the pending `pypi` deployment, and watch the run to completion.\n6. Confirm PyPI serves 0.14.0, the v0.14.0 GitHub Release exists and is Latest, and the MCP Registry lists 0.14.0; run `pypi-attestations verify pypi` on the wheel.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] pyproject.toml, server.json, api_surface_baseline.json and uv.lock all say 0.14.0, and the release commit is merged on main.\n- [ ] CHANGELOG.md has `## [Unreleased]` at the top followed by `## [0.14.0]`.\n- [ ] docs/releasing.md step 1 lists uv.lock.\n- [ ] `https://pypi.org/pypi/nava-rebar/json` reports 0.14.0. [non-codebase]\n  provenance: curl after the release run.\n- [ ] GitHub Release v0.14.0 exists and is marked Latest. [non-codebase]\n  provenance: `gh release view v0.14.0`.\n- [ ] The MCP Registry lists io.github.navapbc/rebar 0.14.0. [non-codebase]\n  provenance: registry search API after the run.\n\n## File impact (expected)\n- pyproject.toml\n- server.json\n- uv.lock\n- tests/unit/api_surface_baseline.json\n- CHANGELOG.md\n- docs/releasing.md","id":"9640-b716-a998-4d0c","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Release rebar 0.14.0"},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1793321413973381001,"uuid":"1b73bb67-d056-4a05-bb6a-eb6f78e18a5a"}